{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/eb007a958c66ca1110457e96fc52f375.poster.avif?t=1762455793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/eb007a958c66ca1110457e96fc52f375.webm?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/eb007a958c66ca1110457e96fc52f375.mp4?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fresh twist on the classic block puzzle formula.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SpinGrid challenges your reflexes and strategy in a rotating arena where the rules are simple but the gameplay is endlessly engaging. Instead of clearing lines, you\u2019ll need to create solid 3x3 block formations \u2014 all while the playfield spins and an indestructible core stone sits at the center of every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move counts. Every rotation changes your perspective. Can you adapt and outlast the spin?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Rotating Arena \u2013 After every round, the grid spins, forcing you to think ahead and adapt your strategy on the fly.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea8 Core Stone Mechanic \u2013 The unbreakable stone at the center changes how you place your pieces, making every match feel unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 3x3 Challenge \u2013 Forget line clears; the goal is to form 3x3 blocks for points. Simple to learn, tricky to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/47b69110376a73d4a7eeaee2b30e40fa.poster.avif?t=1762455793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/47b69110376a73d4a7eeaee2b30e40fa.webm?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/47b69110376a73d4a7eeaee2b30e40fa.mp4?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three Game Modes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed \u2013 No pressure, no speed increase. Perfect for practicing or unwinding.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard \u2013 Classic puzzle action with gradually increasing drop speeds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore \u2013 Faster, tougher, with falling stone blocks that can only be destroyed through clever play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Global Leaderboards \u2013 Compete against players worldwide in all three modes and prove your block mastery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/a7899802d6353c14917811ce3a9d45c4.poster.avif?t=1762455793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/a7899802d6353c14917811ce3a9d45c4.webm?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/a7899802d6353c14917811ce3a9d45c4.mp4?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Play SpinGrid?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re looking for a relaxing puzzle session, a test of quick thinking, or a competitive score chase, SpinGrid offers something for everyone. With its simple controls, rotating twist on classic block puzzlers, and addictive gameplay loop, it\u2019s a game you\u2019ll keep coming back to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to spin, place, and outsmart the grid.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Frist Game!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067490/7691aff1ca6c205613835c7659bd31e39cd96742.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067490/1d751d86b07df7c13bffdd6c6e163da7bc4ebf20.jpg"},{"name":"Rising Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067490/c306c04b8906f3e59158da23ee49afec0ea870cb.jpg"},{"name":"Score Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067490/6763e2927c4686b25db173529c04c2fc8c56caab.jpg"},{"name":"Elite Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067490/dda6fe5dcac06f01d671dc0474b9512fea7a009b.jpg"},{"name":"Spinner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067490/f03b17996463d7179eb45bb557fc0bd8193226fc.jpg"},{"name":"Rotation Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067490/4870eb1c2de248c5cc1332156bacf8902fd130f1.jpg"},{"name":"Rotation Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067490/46c6bcf2ab11271d4cf2d6aa0ba507c372b08b0f.jpg"},{"name":"Rotation Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067490/ed5bb4fb87d497537562d8083d2f79b0d26251e3.jpg"},{"name":"Level 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4067490/30e203dd353011370c76667caaaed8af2e1d4342.j