tougher, with falling stone blocks that can only be destroyed through clever play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Global Leaderboards \u2013 Compete against players worldwide in all three modes and prove your block mastery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/a7899802d6353c14917811ce3a9d45c4.poster.avif?t=1762455793\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/a7899802d6353c14917811ce3a9d45c4.webm?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/extras/a7899802d6353c14917811ce3a9d45c4.mp4?t=1762455793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Play SpinGrid?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re looking for a relaxing puzzle session, a test of quick thinking, or a competitive score chase, SpinGrid offers something for everyone. With its simple controls, rotating twist on classic block puzzlers, and addictive gameplay loop, it\u2019s a game you\u2019ll keep coming back to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to spin, place, and outsmart the grid.</p>","developers":["Exopoint Initiative"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067490/6401f5ad62745d693c09d8b57e74f9b48c7121ab/header.jpg?t=1762455793","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4067490/1285406709/ef856e15e6bc2c050a978c8769d17032fe59b288/1760382915/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760715753","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamsta